prompts.text:
I want a new random map script for Age of Empires II DE.
Idea: {idea}
Map type: {map_type}

First ask me what you need to know: map type, map sizes, player counts, teams, and game mode. Then read read_guide("workflow") and read_guide("skeleton") and start from the skeleton. Work in small steps with edit_file, generate_map, and get_picture, and tell me what each step changes.

Teach me to write random map scripts for Age of Empires II DE.
Topic: {topic}
My level: {level}

Read read_guide("teaching") first. Be a patient tutor: one concept at a time, in small steps. For each step, make a small edit in a practice file, generate the map with compare_to the previous map, and show me the difference with get_picture view compare. Use lookup_reference for every new command and explain it in plain words. Check that I understood before you move on.
